Description: Package for downloading and processing wildfire data from the
    Brazilian Wildfire Database (BDQUEIMADAS) of the National Institute for
    Space Research (INPE). Allows filtering data by period, states, and
    satellites, with automatic record deduplication. Provides functions for
    data download, processing, and visualization of fire spot locations.
